{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-symphony-imtiaz-developments-meydan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1361,"crm_id":"6928","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"The Symphony","slug":"the-symphony-imtiaz-developments-meydan","display_address":"Meydan","building_type":["apartment","offices"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Imtiaz Developments","price":1800000,"display_price":"1.8M","lattitude":25.180028108001,"longitude":55.323780725703,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Symphony by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-imtiaz-developments/\">Imtiaz Developments</a> is a 39-floor architectural landmark thoughtfully designed with 290 residential units. Designed by Zaha Hadid Architects, it offers a refined selection of <strong>1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments alongside exclusive penthouses</strong>, complemented by integrated offices and retail units that enhance everyday convenience within a single vertical composition.</p><p>Located within <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/bukadra/\">Bukadra</a>, The Symphony at Meydan Horizon presents a lifestyle shaped by design, functionality, and long-term value. Residents enjoy access to adult and kids’ pool, observatory deck, sun loungers, and clubhouse, creating a well-balanced living environment that supports comfort, leisure, and strong roi potential.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_010d656046.jpg","hash":"Feature_010d656046","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_a6605b9cc9.jpg","hash":"Banner_a6605b9cc9","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https